<title>UK: NationsBank reduces FX operations in London.</title>
<headline>NationsBank reduces FX operations in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. bank NationsBank Corp said on Wednesday it had reduced its foreign exchange operations in London and was continuing to consolidate functions into its Chicago office.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that no other businesses in the London office were affected.</p>
<p>The bank said it anticipated continuing to have a foreign exchange and trading presence in London.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
